  "description": "<div>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>This position is listed on behalf of a partner company, who manages all applications and next steps. Our partner is looking for an AI Trainers Network – Arabic based in Switzerland.</strong></p>\n<p>Join a global network of language professionals and culturally aware contributors helping shape the future of artificial intelligence.<br>In this flexible, remote opportunity, you can contribute to projects that improve the accuracy, relevance, and inclusivity of AI systems.<br>Depending on your skills and availability, you may work on text, image, or audio annotation, content evaluation, and prompt creation.<br>Your Arabic language expertise and cultural understanding will help make AI-generated content more natural, reliable, and representative of diverse communities.<br>Projects vary in scope and duration, offering opportunities to gain experience with emerging AI technologies while working on your own terms.<br>This is a talent network opportunity rather than an active job opening, meaning you will be contacted when a suitable project becomes available.<br>Before each project begins, you will receive clear information about the tasks, timeline, and compensation so you can decide whether it fits your interests and availability.</p>\n</div><br><strong>Accountabilities</strong><br><div>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 3 []\">As a contributor to the AI Trainers Network, you will support projects designed to improve AI performance, language understanding, and content quality. Depending on the project requirements and your areas of expertise, your responsibilities may include:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<p>Annotating and labeling text, images, or audio to help train and improve AI models.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Evaluating search results, advertisements, and chatbot responses for accuracy, relevance, quality, and usefulness.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Creating, testing, and refining prompts to improve the performance of large language models (LLMs).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Reviewing AI-generated content to ensure linguistic accuracy, natural Arabic expression, and cultural appropriateness.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Identifying errors, inconsistencies, and potentially misleading or unsuitable content in AI outputs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Applying project-specific guidelines and quality standards while maintaining consistency and attention to detail.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Contributing feedback that helps develop safer, more inclusive, and human-centered AI systems.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Managing assigned tasks independently and meeting project deadlines according to agreed requirements and availability.</p>\n</li>\n\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<p>We are looking for detail-oriented, curious, and adaptable contributors who are interested in language, technology, and the development of AI systems. The ideal candidate combines strong Arabic language skills with the ability to evaluate information critically and work independently in a digital environment.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<p>Native or near-native fluency in Arabic, with a strong understanding of grammar, vocabulary, and linguistic nuances.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Current residence in Poland for this opportunity.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Good English proficiency to understand project instructions and communicate effectively.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Comfort using digital tools, online platforms, and web-based applications.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Strong attention to detail and the ability to identify linguistic, factual, and contextual inconsistencies.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Good analytical and critical-thinking skills, particularly when evaluating content for accuracy and relevance.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cultural awareness and an understanding of Arabic-speaking communities, communication styles, and regional language variations.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ability to follow detailed guidelines, work independently, and deliver consistent, high-quality results.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Curiosity about artificial intelligence, language technologies, and how human feedback can improve AI systems.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Flexibility to participate in projects of varying durations and complexity, depending on your availability.</p>\n</li>\n\n<p>Previous experience in data annotation, content evaluation, translation, linguistics, prompt engineering, or AI training may be helpful, but project-specific requirements will vary.</p>\n<h2>Benefits</h2>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<p><strong>Flexible, remote work:</strong> Contribute to suitable projects from your preferred working environment, subject to individual project requirements.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Control over your availability:</strong> Choose whether to participate when a project matches your schedule and interests.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Project-based opportunities:</strong> Access assignments that may last from a few days to several weeks, depending on scope and demand.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Transparent compensation:</strong> Receive project-specific details about payment, tasks, and timelines before deciding whether to participate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Practical AI experience:</strong> Develop your understanding of AI training, data annotation, language evaluation, and large language models.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Meaningful contribution:</strong> Help build more accurate, inclusive, and culturally aware AI technologies.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Global contributor community:</strong> Become part of an international network of people contributing their linguistic and cultural expertise.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Opportunities to grow:</strong> Build relevant skills through exposure to different projects and evolving AI technologies.</p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></ul></ul></div><div><strong>How Company 44135870351a works:</strong></div>\n<div>We use an <strong>AI-powered matching process</strong> to ensure your application is reviewed quickly, objectively, and fairly against the role's core requirements. Our system identifies the top-fitting candidates, and this shortlist is then shared directly with the hiring company. The final decision and next steps (interviews, assessments) are managed by their internal team.</div>\n<div>We appreciate your interest and wish you the best!</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://company-fa98799d218d.example.com/company-2e3828735f47\"> Why Apply Through Company 44135870351a?</a> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><strong>Data Privacy Notice:</strong> By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Company 44135870351a will process your personal data to evaluate your candidacy and share relevant information with the hiring employer. This processing is based on legitimate interest and pre-contractual measures under applicable data protection laws (including GDPR). You may exercise your rights (access, rectification, erasure, objection) at any time.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>#LI-CL1</div><p>Find more <a href=\"https://company-62ba4f226805.example.com/company-78e0c2a75343\">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>",
